[{"s":76,"a":28,"en":"We have created them and strengthened their forms, and when We will, We can change their likenesses with [complete] alteration.","w":[["نَّحۡنُ","We"],["خَلَقۡنَٰهُمۡ","created them"],["وَشَدَدۡنَآ","and We strengthened"],["أَسۡرَهُمۡۖ","their forms"],["وَإِذَا","and when"],["شِئۡنَا","We will"],["بَدَّلۡنَآ","We can change"],["أَمۡثَٰلَهُمۡ","their likeness [es]"],["تَبۡدِيلًا","(with) a change"]]},{"s":32,"a":18,"en":"Then is one who was a believer like one who was defiantly disobedient? They are not equal.","w":[["أَفَمَن","Then is one who"],["كَانَ","is"],["مُؤۡمِنٗا","a believer"],["كَمَن","like (him) who"],["كَانَ","is"],["فَاسِقٗاۚ","defiantly disobedient"],["لَّا","Not"],["يَسۡتَوُۥنَ","they are equal"]]},{"s":88,"a":24,"en":"Then Allah will punish him with the greatest punishment.","w":[["فَيُعَذِّبُهُ","Then will punish him"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["ٱلۡعَذَابَ","(with) the punishment"],["ٱلۡأَكۡبَرَ","greatest"]]},{"s":106,"a":4,"en":"Who has fed them, [saving them] from hunger and made them safe, [saving them] from fear.","w":[["ٱلَّذِيٓ","The One Who"],["أَطۡعَمَهُم","feeds them"],["مِّن","[from]"],["جُوعٖ","(against) hunger"],["وَءَامَنَهُم","and gives them security"],["مِّنۡ","from"],["خَوۡفِۭ","fear"]]},{"s":53,"a":36,"en":"Or has he not been informed of what was in the scriptures of Moses","w":[["أَمۡ","Or"],["لَمۡ","not"],["يُنَبَّأۡ","he was informed"],["بِمَا","with what"],["فِي","(was) in"],["صُحُفِ","(the) Scriptures"],["مُوسَىٰ","(of) Musa"]]},{"s":40,"a":14,"en":"So invoke Allah, [being] sincere to Him in religion, although the disbelievers dislike it.","w":[["فَٱدۡعُواْ","So invoke"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["مُخۡلِصِينَ","(being) sincere"],["لَهُ","to Him"],["ٱلدِّينَ","(in) the religion"],["وَلَوۡ","even though"],["كَرِهَ","dislike (it)"],["ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ","the disbelievers"]]},{"s":111,"a":1,"en":"May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","w":[["تَبَّتۡ","Perish"],["يَدَآ","(the) hands"],["أَبِي","(of) Abu"],["لَهَبٖ","Lahab"],["وَتَبَّ","and perish he"]]},{"s":92,"a":19,"en":"And not [giving] for anyone who has [done him] a favor to be rewarded","w":[["وَمَا","And not"],["لِأَحَدٍ","for anyone"],["عِندَهُۥ","with him"],["مِن","any"],["نِّعۡمَةٖ","favor"],["تُجۡزَىٰٓ","to be recompensed"]]},{"s":36,"a":19,"en":"They said, \"Your omen is with yourselves. Is it because you were reminded? Rather, you are a transgressing people.\"","w":[["قَالُواْ","They said"],["طَـٰٓئِرُكُم","Your evil omen"],["مَّعَكُمۡ","(be) with you"],["أَئِن","Is it because"],["ذُكِّرۡتُمۚ","you are admonished"],["بَلۡ","Nay"],["أَنتُمۡ","you"],["قَوۡمٞ","(are) a people"],["مُّسۡرِفُونَ","transgressing"]]},{"s":83,"a":14,"en":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning.","w":[["كَلَّاۖ","Nay"],["بَلۡۜ","But"],["رَانَ","(the) stain has covered"],["عَلَىٰ","[over]"],["قُلُوبِهِم","their hearts"],["مَّا","(for) what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَكۡسِبُونَ","earn"]]},{"s":84,"a":21,"en":"And when the Qur'an is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allah]?","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when"],["قُرِئَ","is recited"],["عَلَيۡهِمُ","to them"],["ٱلۡقُرۡءَانُ","the Quran"],["لَا","not"],["يَسۡجُدُونَۤ۩","they prostrate"]]},{"s":70,"a":35,"en":"They will be in gardens, honored.","w":[["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","Those"],["فِي","(will be) in"],["جَنَّـٰتٖ","Gardens"],["مُّكۡرَمُونَ","honored"]]},{"s":112,"a":3,"en":"He neither begets nor is born,","w":[["لَمۡ","Not"],["يَلِدۡ","He begets"],["وَلَمۡ","and not"],["يُولَدۡ","He is begotten"]]},{"s":54,"a":29,"en":"But they called their companion, and he dared and hamstrung [her].","w":[["فَنَادَوۡاْ","But they called"],["صَاحِبَهُمۡ","their companion"],["فَتَعَاطَىٰ","and he took"],["فَعَقَرَ","and hamstrung"]]},{"s":21,"a":88,"en":"So We responded to him and saved him from the distress. And thus do We save the believers.","w":[["فَٱسۡتَجَبۡنَا","So We responded"],["لَهُۥ","to him"],["وَنَجَّيۡنَٰهُ","and We saved him"],["مِنَ","from"],["ٱلۡغَمِّۚ","the distress"],["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","And thus"],["نُـۨجِي","We save"],["ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","the believers"]]},{"s":23,"a":87,"en":"They will say, \"[They belong] to Allah.\" Say, \"Then will you not fear Him?\"","w":[["سَيَقُولُونَ","They will say"],["لِلَّهِۚ","Allah"],["قُلۡ","Say"],["أَفَلَا","Then will not"],["تَتَّقُونَ","you fear (Him)"]]},{"s":81,"a":25,"en":"And the Qur'an is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].","w":[["وَمَا","And not"],["هُوَ","it"],["بِقَوۡلِ","(is the) word"],["شَيۡطَٰنٖ","(of) Shaitaan"],["رَّجِيمٖ","accursed"]]},{"s":50,"a":14,"en":"And the companions of the thicket and the people of Tubba'. All denied the messengers, so My threat was justly fulfilled.","w":[["وَأَصۡحَٰبُ","And (the) companions"],["ٱلۡأَيۡكَةِ","(of) the wood"],["وَقَوۡمُ","and (the) people"],["تُبَّعٖۚ","(of) Tubba"],["كُلّٞ","All"],["كَذَّبَ","denied"],["ٱلرُّسُلَ","the Messengers"],["فَحَقَّ","so was fulfilled"],["وَعِيدِ","My Threat"]]},{"s":68,"a":10,"en":"And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer","w":[["وَلَا","And (do) not"],["تُطِعۡ","obey"],["كُلَّ","every"],["حَلَّافٖ","habitual swearer"],["مَّهِينٍ","worthless"]]},{"s":100,"a":11,"en":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["رَبَّهُم","their Lord"],["بِهِمۡ","about them"],["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","that Day"],["لَّخَبِيرُۢ","(is) surely All-Aware"]]},{"s":61,"a":13,"en":"And [you will obtain] another [favor] that you love - victory from Allah and an imminent conquest; and give good tidings to the believers.","w":[["وَأُخۡرَىٰ","And another"],["تُحِبُّونَهَاۖ","that you love"],["نَصۡرٞ","a help"],["مِّنَ","from"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["وَفَتۡحٞ","and a victory"],["قَرِيبٞۗ","near"],["وَبَشِّرِ","and give glad tidings"],["ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","(to) the believers"]]},{"s":65,"a":9,"en":"And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.","w":[["فَذَاقَتۡ","So it tasted"],["وَبَالَ","(the bad) consequence"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["وَكَانَ","and was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["خُسۡرًا","loss"]]},{"s":98,"a":2,"en":"A Messenger from Allah, reciting purified scriptures","w":[["رَسُولٞ","A Messenger"],["مِّنَ","from"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["يَتۡلُواْ","reciting"],["صُحُفٗا","pages"],["مُّطَهَّرَةٗ","purified"]]},{"s":75,"a":26,"en":"No! When the soul has reached the collar bones","w":[["كَلَّآ","No"],["إِذَا","When"],["بَلَغَتِ","it reaches"],["ٱلتَّرَاقِيَ","the collar bones"]]},{"s":77,"a":44,"en":"Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed,We"],["كَذَٰلِكَ","thus"],["نَجۡزِي","reward"],["ٱلۡمُحۡسِنِينَ","the good-doers"]]},{"s":57,"a":1,"en":"Whatever is in the heavens and earth exalts Allah, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["سَبَّحَ","Glorifies"],["لِلَّهِ","[to] Allah"],["مَا","whatever"],["فِي","(is) in"],["ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","the heavens"],["وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۖ","and the earth"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["ٱلۡعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty"],["ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise"]]},{"s":109,"a":2,"en":"I do not worship what you worship.","w":[["لَآ","Not"],["أَعۡبُدُ","I worship"],["مَا","what"],["تَعۡبُدُونَ","you worship"]]},{"s":71,"a":8,"en":"Then I invited them publicly.","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["إِنِّي","indeed,I"],["دَعَوۡتُهُمۡ","invited them"],["جِهَارٗا","publicly"]]},{"s":64,"a":18,"en":"Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["عَٰلِمُ","(The) Knower"],["ٱلۡغَيۡبِ","(of) the unseen"],["وَٱلشَّهَٰدَةِ","and the witnessed"],["ٱلۡعَزِيزُ","the All-Mighty"],["ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise"]]},{"s":86,"a":10,"en":"Then man will have no power or any helper.","w":[["فَمَا","Then not"],["لَهُۥ","(is) for him"],["مِن","any"],["قُوَّةٖ","power"],["وَلَا","and not"],["نَاصِرٖ","any helper"]]}]